  partName: Compressor Blade
  description: The compressor blade is a large, complex component located on the
    right side of the engine, responsible for compressing air and directing it towards
    the combustion chamber. Its metal-mid material and extremely high vertex count
    suggest a high level of engineering complexity and attention to detail. The compressor
    blade is a critical component of the engine, requiring precise design and engineering
    to achieve efficient compression and power generation.
